From 2f7576b25e806f552bf218ac60f69ecd2d253a72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:18:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: piano_mca: implement ordinary full and
 recharge votes

Complete the ordinary whole-pack termination path after the pump hands
over to the PMIC. Honor hardware termination and five distinct tail-current
samples in the normal high-voltage profile, and stop both battery charge
paths while maintaining the normal voltage and external input policy.

Use the factory parallel-gauge integer capacity weights for the 97 percent
raw-SOC recharge threshold. Keep the full vote independent of manual stops,
thermal limits, firmware restarts and transient source losses; clear it on
a real connector change. Preserve the separate low-voltage thermal stop.

Signed-off-by: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/power/supply/piano_mca.c      | 130 ++++++++++-
 drivers/power/supply/piano_mca_test.c | 296 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 424 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

